msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: zh_CN\n"

msgid "-"
msgstr "-"

msgid "(experimental) Win32, using WGL for rendering and Direct3D 9Ex for presentation. Works on Nvidia and AMD. Newer Intel chips with the latest drivers may also work."
msgstr "（实验性）Win32，使用 WGL 进行渲染，使用 Direct3D 9Ex 进行呈现。可在 Nvidia 和 AMD 上工作。较新的 Intel 芯片搭配最新驱动程序也可能可以工作。"

msgid "+10%"
msgstr "+10%"

msgid "<0-100> Set the JPEG quality level. Higher means better quality. The default is 90."
msgstr "<0-100> 设置 JPEG 质量等级。数值越高画质越好。默认值为 90。"

msgid "<0-32> In multi-monitor configurations (i.e. a single desktop that spans across multiple displays), this option tells mpv which screen to display the video on."
msgstr "<0-32> 在多显示器配置中（即单个桌面横跨多个显示器），此选项指定 mpv 在哪个屏幕上显示视频。"

msgid "<0-5> Set the filter applied prior to PNG compression. 0 is none, 1 is 'sub', 2 is 'up', 3 is 'average', 4 is 'Paeth', and 5 is 'mixed'. This affects the level of compression that can be achieved. For most images, 'mixed' achieves the best compression ratio, hence it is the default."
msgstr "<0-5> 设置 PNG 压缩前应用的滤镜。0 为无，1 为 'sub'，2 为 'up'，3 为 'average'，4 为 'Paeth'，5 为 'mixed'。此选项影响可达到的压缩级别。对大多数图像而言，'mixed' 能达到最佳压缩比，因此它是默认值。"

msgid "<0-9> Set the PNG compression level. Higher means better compression. This will affect the file size of the written screenshot file and the time it takes to write a screenshot. Too high compression might occupy enough CPU time to interrupt playback. The default is 7."
msgstr "<0-9> 设置 PNG 压缩级别。数值越高压缩越好。这会影响写入的截图文件大小以及写入截图所需的时间。过高的压缩可能占用大量 CPU 时间，以致中断播放。默认值为 7。"

msgid "<bytesize> Controls how much the demuxer is allowed to buffer ahead.\nSuffixes such as KiB and MiB are supported."
msgstr "<bytesize> 控制允许解复用器向前缓冲的数据量。\n支持 KiB 和 MiB 等后缀。"

msgid "<float >= 1> Hold-speed multiplier for hold-speed-key. Release restores previous speed. Set to 0 or 1 to disable. (mpv.net specific option)"
msgstr "<浮点数 >= 1> 长按倍速倍率（配合 hold-speed-key）。松开恢复原倍速。设为 0 或 1 可关闭。（mpv.net 专用选项）"

msgid "<float> Minimum aspect ratio of the window. Useful to force a wider window and therefore a larger OSC. (mpv.net specific option)"
msgstr "<float> 窗口的最小宽高比。可用于强制更宽的窗口，从而获得更大的 OSC。（mpv.net 专用选项）"

msgid "<int> Amount of recent files to be remembered. Default: 50 (mpv.net specific option)"
msgstr "<int> 记住的最近文件数量。默认：50（mpv.net 专用选项）"

msgid "<int> Initial window height in percent for audio files. Default: 70"
msgstr "<int> 音频文件的初始窗口高度百分比。默认值：70"

msgid "<int> Initial window height in percent for image files. Default: 80"
msgstr "<int> 图片文件的初始窗口高度百分比。默认值：80"

msgid "<int> Initial window height in percent. Default: 60"
msgstr "<int> 初始窗口高度百分比。默认值：60"

msgid "<int> Maximum window height in percent. Default: 80"
msgstr "<int> 最大窗口高度百分比。默认值：80"

msgid "<int> Minimum window height in percent. Default: 10"
msgstr "<int> 最小窗口高度百分比。默认值：10"

msgid "<N|inf|force|no> Loops playback N times. A value of 1 plays it one time (default), 2 two times, etc. inf means forever. no is the same as 1 and disables looping. If several files are specified on command line, the entire playlist is looped. The force mode is like inf, but does not skip playlist entries which have been marked as failing. This means the player might waste CPU time trying to loop a file that doesn't exist. But it might be useful for playing webradios under very bad network conditions."
msgstr "<N|inf|force|no> 循环播放 N 次。值为 1 表示播放一次（默认），2 表示播放两次，依此类推。inf 表示永远循环。no 等同于 1，即禁用循环。如果在命令行中指定了多个文件，则循环整个播放列表。force 模式类似于 inf，但不会跳过被标记为失败的播放列表条目。这意味着播放器可能会浪费 CPU 时间去尝试循环一个不存在的文件。但在非常糟糕的网络条件下播放网络电台时，这可能很有用。"

msgid "<N|inf|no> Loop a single file N times. inf means forever, no means normal playback.\n\nThe difference to loop-playlist is that this doesn't loop the playlist, just the file itself. If the playlist contains only a single file, the difference between the two option is that this option performs a seek on loop, instead of reloading the file. loop is an alias for this option."
msgstr "<N|inf|no> 循环单个文件 N 次。inf 表示永远循环，no 表示正常播放。\n\n与 loop-playlist 的区别在于：此选项不循环播放列表，只循环文件本身。如果播放列表只包含单个文件，两者的区别是此选项在循环时执行一次跳转（seek），而不是重新加载文件。loop 是此选项的别名。"

msgid "<name> Use the given audio device. This consists of the audio output name, e.g. alsa, followed by /, followed by the audio output specific device name. The default value for this option is auto, which tries every audio output in preference order with the default device.\nAvailable devices can be found in the context menu under:\nView > Advanced > Show Audio Devices"
msgstr "<name> 使用指定的音频设备。由音频输出名称（如 alsa）+ / + 该音频输出特定的设备名称组成。此选项默认值为 auto，即按优先顺序依次以默认设备尝试每个音频输出。\n可用设备可在右键菜单的以下位置查看：\n工具 > 输出文本 > 音频设备列表"

msgid "-10%"
msgstr "-10%"

msgid "100 %"
msgstr "100%"

msgid "200 %"
msgstr "200%"

msgid "300 %"
msgstr "300%"

msgid "50 %"
msgstr "50%"

msgid "A slightly sharpened version of ewa_lanczos, preconfigured to use an ideal radius and parameter. If your hardware can run it, this is probably what you should use by default."
msgstr "ewa_lanczos 的轻微锐化版本，预先配置为使用理想的半径和参数。如果你的硬件能够运行它，这可能是你应该默认使用的。"

msgid "A version of nearest neighbour that (naively) oversamples pixels, so that pixels overlapping edges get linearly interpolated instead of rounded. This essentially removes the small imperfections and judder artifacts caused by nearest-neighbour interpolation, in exchange for adding some blur. This filter is good at temporal interpolation, and also known as \"smoothmotion\" (see tscale)."
msgstr "最近邻插值的一个版本，（简单地）对像素进行过采样，使与边缘重叠的像素按线性插值处理而不是取整。这基本上消除了最近邻插值造成的小瑕疵和抖动伪影，代价是增加一些模糊。此滤镜擅长时间插值，也被称为 \"smoothmotion\"（参见 tscale）。"

msgid "About mpv.net"
msgstr "关于"

msgid "Add files to playlist..."
msgstr "添加到当前列表"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgid "Allow only gpu-context=d3d11"
msgstr "仅允许 gpu-context=d3d11"

msgid "Allow only OpenGL (requires OpenGL 2.1+ or GLES 2.0+)"
msgstr "仅允许 OpenGL（需要 OpenGL 2.1+ 或 GLES 2.0+）"

msgid "Allow only Vulkan"
msgstr "仅允许 Vulkan"

msgid "Always save the current playback position on quit. When this file is played again later, the player will seek to the old playback position on start. This does not happen if playback of a file is stopped in any other way than quitting. For example, going to the next file in the playlist will not save the position, and start playback at beginning the next time the file is played.\n\nEnabled by default in mpv.net. Quitting with Shift+Q always saves the position even when this option is no."
msgstr "退出时总是保存当前播放位置。以后再次播放此文件时，播放器将在开始时跳转到上次的播放位置。如果播放以退出以外的任何方式停止，则不会保存位置。例如，转到播放列表中的下一个文件不会保存位置，下次播放该文件时将从头开始播放。\n\nmpv.net 默认开启。即使此项为 no，用 Shift+Q 退出时仍会保存进度。"

msgid "always use software decoding"
msgstr "总是使用软件解码"

msgid "As scale, but for interpolating chroma information. If the image is not subsampled, this option is ignored entirely."
msgstr "与 scale 相同，但用于插值色度信息。如果图像没有经过子采样，此选项将被完全忽略。"

msgid "Audio"
msgstr "音频"

msgid "Audio > -"
msgstr "音频 > -"

msgid "Audio > Cycle/Next"
msgstr "音频 > 切换 音频轨"

msgid "Audio > Delay +0.1"
msgstr "音频 > 延迟 +0.1"

msgid "Audio > Delay -0.1"
msgstr "音频 > 延迟 -0.1"

msgid "Audio file extensions used to create file associations and used by the auto-load-folder feature. (mpv.net specific option)"
msgstr "用于创建文件关联并被自动加载文件夹功能使用的音频文件扩展名。（mpv.net 专用选项）"

msgid "Automatic selection. If output bit depth cannot be detected, 8 bits per component are assumed."
msgstr "自动选择。如果无法检测输出位深，则假定为每分量 8 位。"

msgid "auto-select"
msgstr "自动选择"

msgid "Available on Windows 10 or higher"
msgstr "在 Windows 10 或更高版本上可用"

msgid "Bilinear hardware texture filtering (fastest, very low quality)."
msgstr "双线性硬件纹理过滤（最快，质量非常低）。"

msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "底部"

msgid "By default, when using hardware decoding with --gpu-api=d3d11, the video image will be copied (GPU-to-GPU) from the decoder surface to a shader resource. Set this option to avoid that copy by sampling directly from the decoder image. This may increase performance and reduce power usage, but can cause the image to be sampled incorrectly on the bottom and right edges due to padding, and may invoke driver bugs, since Direct3D 11 technically does not allow sampling from a decoder surface (though most drivers support it.)"
msgstr "默认情况下，使用 --gpu-api=d3d11 进行硬件解码时，视频图像会从解码器表面（GPU 到 GPU）复制到着色器资源。设置此选项可直接从解码器图像采样，从而避免该复制。这可能提升性能并降低功耗，但由于边缘填充（padding），可能导致图像底部和右侧边缘采样不正确，还可能引发驱动程序 bug，因为 Direct3D 11 在技术上不允许从解码器表面采样（尽管大多数驱动程序支持）。"

msgid "Cache"
msgstr "缓存"

msgid "Center"
msgstr "居中"

msgid "Changes between a light and dark theme.\nmpv.net must be restarted after a change.\nmpv.net specific option."
msgstr "在浅色与深色主题之间切换。\n更改后必须重启 mpv.net。\nmpv.net 专用选项。"

msgid "Chapters"
msgstr "章节"

msgid "Chinese (Simplified)"
msgstr "简体中文"

msgid "Clear file associations (requires admin)"
msgstr "取消关联"

msgid "Color theme used in dark mode.\nmpv.net must be restarted after a change.\nmpv.net specific option. Default: dark"
msgstr "深色模式下使用的颜色主题。\n更改后必须重启 mpv.net。\nmpv.net 专用选项。默认值：dark"

msgid "Color theme used in light mode.\nmpv.net must be restarted after a change.\nmpv.net specific option. Default: light"
msgstr "浅色模式下使用的颜色主题。\n更改后必须重启 mpv.net。\nmpv.net 专用选项。默认值：light"

msgid "Command Palette"
msgstr "命令面板"

msgid "Compute the HDR peak and frame average brightness per-frame instead of relying on tagged metadata. These values are averaged over local regions as well as over several frames to prevent the value from jittering around too much. This option basically gives you dynamic, per-scene tone mapping. Requires compute shaders, which is a fairly recent OpenGL feature, and will probably also perform horribly on some drivers, so enable at your own risk. The special value auto (default) will enable HDR peak computation automatically if compute shaders and SSBOs are supported."
msgstr "逐帧计算 HDR 峰值和帧平均亮度，而不是依赖标记的元数据。这些值会在局部区域以及多帧之间取平均，以防止数值过度抖动。此选项基本上可提供动态的逐场景色调映射。需要计算着色器（compute shaders），这是一个较新的 OpenGL 特性，并且在某些驱动程序上可能表现极差，因此请自担风险地启用。特殊值 auto（默认）会在支持计算着色器和 SSBO 时自动启用 HDR 峰值计算。"

msgid "Config Editor"
msgstr "配置编辑器"

msgid "Continue last playback: when started without a file, open the most recent media from history. (mpv.net specific option)"
msgstr "继续上次播放：无文件启动时，自动打开最近播放的媒体。（mpv.net 专用选项）"

msgid "Controls which type of graphics APIs will be accepted. Auto uses d3d11, it should only be changed in case of problems, Vulkan is not recommended."
msgstr "控制接受哪种类型的图形 API。auto 使用 d3d11，只应在出现问题时更改，不推荐使用 Vulkan。"

msgid "copies video back to system RAM (Any platform CUDA is available)"
msgstr "将视频复制回系统 RAM（任何支持 CUDA 的平台）"

msgid "copies video back to system RAM (Windows 8+ only)"
msgstr "将视频复制回系统 RAM（仅限 Windows 8+）"

msgid "copies video back to system RAM (Windows only)"
msgstr "将视频复制回系统 RAM（仅限 Windows）"

msgid "Create a new process everytime the shell starts mpv.net"
msgstr "每次 shell 启动 mpv.net 时都创建新进程"

msgid "Cycle Aspect Ratio"
msgstr "切换宽高比"

msgid "Cycle/Next"
msgstr "切换"

msgid "Decide whether to use network cache settings."
msgstr "决定是否使用网络缓存设置。"

msgid "Decrease Brightness"
msgstr "亮度 -1"

msgid "Decrease Contrast"
msgstr "对比度 -1"

msgid "Decrease Gamma"
msgstr "伽马 -1"

msgid "Decrease Height"
msgstr "减小高度"

msgid "Decrease Saturation"
msgstr "饱和度 -1"

msgid "Decrease Size"
msgstr "缩小"

msgid "Decrease Subtitle Font Size"
msgstr "字号 -0.1"

msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认"

msgid "Defines if more then one mpv.net process is allowed. (mpv.net specific option)\n\nMulti can alternatively be enabled by pressing the SHIFT key.\n\nWhenever the control key is pressed when files or URLs are opened, the playlist is not cleared but the files or URLs are appended to the playlist. This not only works on process startup but in all mpv.net features that open files and URLs."
msgstr "定义是否允许运行多个 mpv.net 进程。（mpv.net 专用选项）\n\n也可以通过按住 SHIFT 键来启用 Multi 模式。\n\n只要在打开文件或 URL 时按住 Ctrl 键，播放列表就不会被清空，而是将文件或 URL 追加到播放列表。这不仅适用于进程启动时，也适用于 mpv.net 中所有打开文件和 URL 的功能。"

msgid "Delay +0.1"
msgstr "延迟 +0.1"

msgid "Delay -0.1"
msgstr "延迟 -0.1"

msgid "Delay in milliseconds before we start to autorepeat a key (0 to disable)."
msgstr "开始自动重复按键前的延迟毫秒数（0 为禁用）。"

msgid "Demuxer"
msgstr "解复用"

msgid "Direct3D11 through the OpenGL ES translation layer ANGLE. This supports almost everything the win backend does (if the ANGLE build is new enough)."
msgstr "通过 OpenGL ES 转换层 ANGLE 实现的 Direct3D11。支持 win 后端所支持的几乎所有功能（前提是 ANGLE 构建足够新）。"

msgid "Disable any dithering done by mpv."
msgstr "禁用 mpv 执行的任何抖动（dithering）。"

msgid "Dither to 10 bit output."
msgstr "抖动到 10 位输出。"

msgid "Dither to 8 bit output."
msgstr "抖动到 8 位输出。"

msgid "Don't automatically load external audio files."
msgstr "不自动加载外部音频文件。"

msgid "Don't automatically load external subtitle files."
msgstr "不自动加载外部字幕文件。"

msgid "Double"
msgstr "两倍"

msgid "Down"
msgstr "下"

msgid "Draws the blue mpv.net logo ontop of the native OSC logo."
msgstr "在原生 OSC 标志上绘制蓝色的 mpv.net 标志。"

msgid "Draws the blue mpv.net logo with a santa hat in december, the option is called greenandgrumpy in mpv."
msgstr "在十二月为蓝色的 mpv.net 标志戴上圣诞帽，该选项在 mpv 中名为 greenandgrumpy。"

msgid "Elliptic weighted average Lanczos scaling. Also known as Jinc. Relatively slow, but very good quality. The radius can be controlled with scale-radius. Increasing the radius makes the filter sharper but adds more ringing. (This filter is an alias for jinc-windowed jinc)"
msgstr "椭圆加权平均 Lanczos 缩放。也称为 Jinc。相对较慢，但质量非常好。半径可通过 scale-radius 控制。增大半径会使滤镜更锐利，但会增加振铃。（此滤镜是 jinc 窗化的 jinc 的别名）"

msgid "enable any whitelisted hw decoder"
msgstr "启用白名单中的任何硬件解码器"

msgid "enable best hw decoder"
msgstr "启用最佳硬件解码器"

msgid "enable best hw decoder with copy-back"
msgstr "启用带回拷贝（copy-back）的最佳硬件解码器"

msgid "Enable the debanding algorithm. This greatly reduces the amount of visible banding, blocking and other quantization artifacts, at the expense of very slightly blurring some of the finest details. In practice, it's virtually always an improvement - the only reason to disable it would be for performance."
msgstr "启用去色带（debanding）算法。这能大大减少可见的色带、色块和其他量化伪影，代价是极轻微地模糊一些最细微的细节。实际上它几乎总能带来改善——禁用它的唯一理由是性能。"

msgid "Enable the default track auto-selection. Enabling this will make the player select streams according to aid, alang, and others. If it is disabled, no tracks are selected. In addition, the player will not exit if no tracks are selected, and wait instead (this wait mode is similar to pausing, but the pause option is not set).\n\nThis is useful with lavfi-complex: you can start playback in this mode, and then set select tracks at runtime by setting the filter graph. Note that if lavfi-complex is set before playback is started, the referenced tracks are always selected."
msgstr "启用默认的轨道自动选择。启用后，播放器将根据 aid、alang 等选项选择流。如果禁用，则不选择任何轨道。此外，如果没有选择任何轨道，播放器不会退出，而是等待（此等待模式类似于暂停，但不会设置 pause 选项）。\n\n这在配合 lavfi-complex 时很有用：你可以在此模式下开始播放，然后通过设置滤镜图在运行时选择轨道。注意，如果在播放开始前已设置 lavfi-complex，则被引用的轨道总是会被选择。"

msgid "Enable this only when a developer asks for it. (mpv.net specific option)"
msgstr "仅在开发者要求时才启用。（mpv.net 专用选项）"

msgid "English"
msgstr "英语"

msgid "Enlarge"
msgstr "递增"

msgid "exactly the same as auto"
msgstr "与 auto 完全相同"

msgid "Exit"
msgstr "退出"

msgid "Exit mpv.net"
msgstr "退出"

msgid "Exit Watch Later"
msgstr "退出稍后观看"

msgid "Experimental video renderer based on libplacebo. This supports almost the same set of features as --vo=gpu."
msgstr "基于 libplacebo 的实验性视频渲染器。支持与 --vo=gpu 几乎相同的功能集。"

msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

msgid "Find a setting"
msgstr "查找设置"

msgid "First File"
msgstr "首位文件"

msgid "For single files automatically load the entire directory into the playlist. Can be suppressed via shift key. (mpv.net specific option)"
msgstr "对单个文件自动将整个目录加载到播放列表。可通过按住 Shift 键跳过。（mpv.net 专用选项）"

msgid "Force a single process and add files to playlist"
msgstr "强制单进程并将文件添加到播放列表"

msgid "Force a single process everytime the shell starts mpv.net"
msgstr "每次 shell 启动 mpv.net 时都强制使用单进程"

msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

msgid "General purpose, customizable, GPU-accelerated video output driver. It supports extended scaling methods, dithering, color management, custom shaders, HDR, and more."
msgstr "通用、可自定义、GPU 加速的视频输出驱动。支持扩展的缩放方法、抖动、色彩管理、自定义着色器、HDR 等。"

msgid "Half"
msgstr "一半"

msgid "Help"
msgstr "帮助"

msgid "Help > -"
msgstr "帮助 > -"

msgid "Help > About mpv.net"
msgstr "帮助 > 关于"

msgid "Help > Manual mpv"
msgstr "帮助 > mpv 手册"

msgid "Help > Manual mpv.net"
msgstr "帮助 > mpv.net 手册"

msgid "Help > Website mpv"
msgstr "帮助 > mpv 网站"

msgid "Help > Website mpv.net"
msgstr "帮助 > mpv.net 网站"

msgid "History"
msgstr "播放历史"

msgid "How the player synchronizes audio and video.\n\nFor more information visit:"
msgstr "播放器如何同步音频和视频。\n\n更多信息请访问："

msgid "If possible, write screenshots with a bit depth similar to the source video. This is interesting in particular for PNG, as this sometimes triggers writing 16 bit PNGs with huge file sizes. This will also include an unused alpha channel in the resulting files if 16 bit is used."
msgstr "如果可能，以与源视频相近的位深写入截图。这对 PNG 尤其有意义，因为这有时会触发写入文件体积巨大的 16 位 PNG。如果使用 16 位，结果文件中还会包含一个未使用的 alpha 通道。"

msgid "If set to no and keep-open is also set to no, the player exits after the last file ends."
msgstr "如果设为 no 且 keep-open 也设为 no，播放器将在最后一个文件结束后退出。"

msgid "If set to no, instead of pausing when keep-open is active, just stop at end of file and continue playing forward when you seek backwards until end where it stops again."
msgstr "如果设为 no，当 keep-open 生效时不再暂停，而是在文件末尾停止；向后跳转后会继续向前播放，直到再次到达文件末尾时停止。"

msgid "If the current file ends, go to the next file, keep the last file open."
msgstr "当前文件结束后，转到下一个文件，最后一个文件保持打开。"

msgid "If the current file ends, go to the next file. If idle is set to no, the player exits after the last file."
msgstr "当前文件结束后，转到下一个文件。如果 idle 设为 no，播放器将在最后一个文件结束后退出。"

msgid "Image file extensions used to create file associations and used by the auto-load-folder feature. (mpv.net specific option)"
msgstr "用于创建文件关联并被自动加载文件夹功能使用的图片文件扩展名。（mpv.net 专用选项）"

msgid "Increase Brightness"
msgstr "亮度 +1"

msgid "Increase Contrast"
msgstr "对比度 +1"

msgid "Increase Gamma"
