msgid "Specify a priority list of audio languages to use. Different container formats employ different language codes. DVDs use ISO 639-1 two-letter language codes, Matroska, MPEG-TS and NUT use ISO 639-2 three-letter language codes, while OGM uses a free-form identifier. See also aid.\n\nExamples\n\nmpv dvd://1 alang=hu,en chooses the Hungarian language track on a DVD and falls back on English if Hungarian is not available.\n\nmpv alang=jpn example.mkv plays a Matroska file with Japanese audio."
msgstr "指定要使用的音频语言优先级列表。不同的容器格式使用不同的语言代码。DVD 使用 ISO 639-1 双字母语言代码，Matroska、MPEG-TS 和 NUT 使用 ISO 639-2 三字母语言代码，而 OGM 使用自由格式的标识符。另见 aid。\n\n示例\n\nmpv dvd://1 alang=hu,en 选择 DVD 上的匈牙利语音轨，如果匈牙利语不可用则回退到英语。\n\nmpv alang=jpn example.mkv 以日语音频播放一个 Matroska 文件。"

msgid "Specify a priority list of subtitle languages to use. Different container formats employ different language codes. DVDs use ISO 639-1 two letter language codes, Matroska uses ISO 639-2 three letter language codes while OGM uses a free-form identifier. See also sid."
msgstr "指定要使用的字幕语言优先级列表。不同的容器格式使用不同的语言代码。DVD 使用 ISO 639-1 双字母语言代码，Matroska 使用 ISO 639-2 三字母语言代码，而 OGM 使用自由格式的标识符。另见 sid。"

msgid "Specify font to use for subtitles that do not themselves specify a particular font. The default is  sans-serif."
msgstr "为本身未指定特定字体的字幕指定要使用的字体。默认值为 sans-serif。"

msgid "Specify the color used for unstyled text subtitles.\n\nThe color is specified in the form r/g/b, where each color component is specified as number in the range 0.0 to 1.0. It's also possible to specify the transparency by using r/g/b/a, where the alpha value 0 means fully transparent, and 1.0 means opaque. If the alpha component is not given, the color is 100% opaque.\n\nPassing a single number to the option sets the sub to gray, and the form gray/a lets you specify alpha additionally.\n\nExamples\n\n1.0/0.0/0.0 set sub to opaque red\n1.0/0.0/0.0/0.75 set sub to opaque red with 75% alpha\n0.5/0.75 set sub to 50% gray with 75% alpha\n\nAlternatively, the color can be specified as a RGB hex triplet in the form #RRGGBB, where each 2-digit group expresses a color value in the range 0 (00) to 255 (FF). For example, #FF0000 is red. This is similar to web colors. Alpha is given with #AARRGGBB.\n\nExamples\n\n#FF0000 set sub to opaque red\n#C0808080 set sub to 50% gray with 75% alpha"
msgstr "指定用于无样式文本字幕的颜色。\n\n颜色以 r/g/b 形式指定，每个颜色分量为 0.0 到 1.0 范围内的数字。也可以使用 r/g/b/a 指定透明度，其中 alpha 值 0 表示完全透明，1.0 表示不透明。如果未给出 alpha 分量，则颜色为 100% 不透明。\n\n向此选项传入单个数字会将字幕设为灰色，使用 gray/a 形式可额外指定 alpha。\n\n示例\n\n1.0/0.0/0.0 将字幕设为不透明红色\n1.0/0.0/0.0/0.75 将字幕设为带 75% alpha 的不透明红色\n0.5/0.75 将字幕设为带 75% alpha 的 50% 灰色\n\n另外，颜色也可以指定为 #RRGGBB 形式的 RGB 十六进制三元组，其中每个 2 位组表示 0（00）到 255（FF）范围内的颜色值。例如 #FF0000 是红色。这与网页颜色类似。alpha 用 #AARRGGBB 指定。\n\n示例\n\n#FF0000 将字幕设为不透明红色\n#C0808080 将字幕设为带 75% alpha 的 50% 灰色"

msgid "Specify the filename template used to save screenshots. The template specifies the filename without file extension, and can contain format specifiers, which will be substituted when taking a screenshot. By default, the template is mpv-shot%n, which results in filenames like  mpv-shot0012.png for example.\n\nFind the full documentation here:"
msgstr "指定用于保存截图的文件名模板。模板指定不带扩展名的文件名，可以包含格式说明符，截图时这些说明符会被替换。默认模板为 mpv-shot%n，例如会生成类似 mpv-shot0012.png 的文件名。\n\n完整文档请见："

msgid "Specify the hardware video decoding API that should be used if possible. Whether hardware decoding is actually done depends on the video codec. If hardware decoding is not possible, mpv will fall back on software decoding.\n\nFor more information visit:"
msgstr "指定在可能时应使用的硬件视频解码 API。是否实际进行硬件解码取决于视频编解码器。如果无法进行硬件解码，mpv 将回退到软件解码。\n\n更多信息请访问："

msgid "Specify the OSD font size. See sub-font-size for details. Default: 55"
msgstr "指定 OSD 字号。详情参见 sub-font-size。默认值：55"

msgid "Specify the sub font size. The unit is the size in scaled pixels at a window height of 720. The actual pixel size is scaled with the window height: if the window height is larger or smaller than 720, the actual size of the text increases or decreases as well. Default: 55"
msgstr "指定字幕字号。单位是窗口高度为 720 时以缩放像素计的大小。实际像素大小随窗口高度缩放：如果窗口高度大于或小于 720，文本的实际大小也会相应增大或减小。默认值：55"

