msgid "When upscaling, use a sigmoidal color transform to avoid emphasizing ringing artifacts. This also implies linear-scaling."
msgstr "放大时使用 S 形（sigmoidal）颜色变换，以避免加重振铃伪影。这也意味着使用 linear-scaling。"

msgid "When using convolution based filters, extend the filter size when downscaling. Increases quality, but reduces performance while downscaling.\n\nThis will perform slightly sub-optimally for anamorphic video (but still better than without it) since it will extend the size to match only the milder of the scale factors between the axes."
msgstr "使用基于卷积的滤镜时，在缩小时扩展滤镜尺寸。可提高质量，但会降低缩小时的性能。\n\n对变形宽银幕（anamorphic）视频，表现会略有欠佳（但仍好于不启用），因为它只会将尺寸扩展到两轴缩放因子中较温和的那个。"

msgid "When using --hdr-compute-peak, allow delaying the detected peak by a frame when beneficial for performance. In particular, this is required to avoid an unnecessary FBO indirection when no advanced rendering is required otherwise. Has no effect if there already is an indirect pass, such as when advanced scaling is enabled. (Only affects --vo=gpu-next, note that --vo=gpu always delays the peak.)"
msgstr "使用 --hdr-compute-peak 时，若有利于性能，允许将检测到的峰值延迟一帧。特别是，当其他方面不需要高级渲染时，这可以避免不必要的 FBO 间接传递。如果已经存在间接传递（例如启用了高级缩放），则没有影响。（仅影响 --vo=gpu-next，注意 --vo=gpu 总是延迟峰值。）"

msgid "Whether to scale the OSD with the window size. If this is disabled, osd-font-size and other OSD options that use scaled pixels are always in actual pixels. The effect is that changing the window size won't change the OSD font size."
msgstr "OSD 是否随窗口大小缩放。如果禁用，osd-font-size 和其他使用缩放像素的 OSD 选项将始终以实际像素为单位。效果是更改窗口大小不会改变 OSD 字号。"

